{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 38, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: it(x) = x^2\n  ucas: diff it\nd/dx it = 2x\n  holds for every real x\n  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 2e-15)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 38, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "what is the derivative of x squared", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(x) = x^2", "diff it"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "diff", "vars": ["x"], "order": 1, "derivative": "2x"}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [{"kind": "central_differences", "points": 201, "max_diff": 1.7545867674548653e-15, "passed": true}], "files": [], "text": "  ucas: it(x) = x^2\n  ucas: diff it\nd/dx it = 2x\n  holds for every real x\n  check: matches central differences at 201 points (max relative difference 2e-15)\n"}, "isError": false}}
{"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": 39, "result": {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "  ucas: it(x) = x^3 - 3*x\n  ucas: crit it\ncritical points of it:\n  it' = 3x^2 - 3\n  x ≈ -1: local maximum, it = 2\n  x ≈ 1: local minimum, it = -2\n  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)\n"}], "structuredContent": {"id": 39, "ok": true, "cmd": "english", "ucas": "critical points of x cubed minus 3x", "structured": true, "result": {"kind": "english", "statements": ["it(x) = x^3 - 3*x", "crit it"], "understood": true, "results": [{"kind": "crit", "derivative": "3x^2 - 3", "points": [{"x": -1, "kind": "local maximum", "value": 2}, {"x": 1, "kind": "local minimum", "value": -2}]}]}, "notes": [], "conditions": [], "checks": [], "proof": {"kind": "numeric", "text": "sign changes of the derivative on a grid, refined by bisection"}, "files": [], "text": "  ucas: it(x) = x^3 - 3*x\n  ucas: crit it\ncritical points of it:\n  it' = 3x^2 - 3\n  x ≈ -1: local maximum, it = 2\n  x ≈ 1: local minimum, it = -2\n  searched [-10, 10] (default; give x a range)\n"}, "isError": false}}
